{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>To the priests, the Levites, who carry the Ark</b> etc. And even though the Levites would carry it and not the priests, nevertheless immediately after the death of Moses the priests carried it when Israel crossed the Jordan, as stated in Sotah: it was taught, Rabbi Yosi said: in three places the priests carried the Ark — when they crossed the Jordan, when they circled Jericho, and when they returned it to its place. Another interpretation: because the priests prepare the loads for the Levites, as explained in the pericache of Bamidbar — it calls the priests נושאי ארון ברית ה׳ etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:51.567879187Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}